{
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "slug": "hold-to-confirm",
  "title": "Hold to confirm",
  "group": "Actions",
  "order": 9,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A button you press and hold for 1.2 s to confirm something costly but not dangerous enough for a dialog. A fill sweeps across while you hold and drains if you let go early.",
    "id": "Tombol yang ditekan dan ditahan selama 1,2 detik untuk mengonfirmasi sesuatu yang mahal tetapi tidak cukup berbahaya untuk dialog. Isian menyapu tombol selama ditahan dan surut jika dilepas lebih awal."
  },
  "titleId": "Hold to confirm",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Submit an application",
        "desc": "Press and hold for 1.2 s, or focus it and hold Space or Enter. Let go early and the fill drains.",
        "html": "<button class=\"btn btn--primary hold\" data-lds-hold style=\"min-width: 240px;\" onpointerenter=\"if (!this.dataset.wired) { this.dataset.wired = '1'; this.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { this.lastChild.textContent = 'Application submitted'; this.disabled = true; }); }\" onfocus=\"if (!this.dataset.wired) { this.dataset.wired = '1'; this.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { this.lastChild.textContent = 'Application submitted'; this.disabled = true; }); }\"><span class=\"hold__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">touch_app</span>Hold to submit application</button>",
        "code": "<button class=\"btn btn--primary hold\" data-lds-hold id=\"submit-application\">\n  <span class=\"hold__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">touch_app</span>Hold to submit application\n</button>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  document.getElementById('submit-application').addEventListener('lds:confirm', submitApplication);\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Destructive, local only",
        "desc": "Danger tone for something that removes data on this device and can be downloaded again.",
        "html": "<button class=\"btn btn--danger hold\" data-lds-hold style=\"min-width: 240px;\" onpointerenter=\"if (!this.dataset.wired) { this.dataset.wired = '1'; this.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { this.lastChild.textContent = 'Offline copies deleted'; this.disabled = true; }); }\" onfocus=\"if (!this.dataset.wired) { this.dataset.wired = '1'; this.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { this.lastChild.textContent = 'Offline copies deleted'; this.disabled = true; }); }\"><span class=\"hold__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hold to delete offline copies</button>",
        "code": "<button class=\"btn btn--danger hold\" data-lds-hold>\n  <span class=\"hold__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hold to delete offline copies\n</button>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Mengirim permohonan",
        "desc": "Tekan dan tahan selama 1,2 detik, atau fokuskan lalu tahan Spasi atau Enter. Lepas lebih awal dan isiannya surut.",
        "html": "<button class=\"btn btn--primary hold\" data-lds-hold style=\"min-width: 240px;\" onpointerenter=\"if (!this.dataset.wired) { this.dataset.wired = '1'; this.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { this.lastChild.textContent = 'Permohonan terkirim'; this.disabled = true; }); }\" onfocus=\"if (!this.dataset.wired) { this.dataset.wired = '1'; this.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { this.lastChild.textContent = 'Permohonan terkirim'; this.disabled = true; }); }\"><span class=\"hold__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">touch_app</span>Tahan untuk mengirim permohonan</button>",
        "code": "<button class=\"btn btn--primary hold\" data-lds-hold id=\"submit-application\">\n  <span class=\"hold__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">touch_app</span>Tahan untuk mengirim permohonan\n</button>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  document.getElementById('submit-application').addEventListener('lds:confirm', submitApplication);\n</script>"
      },
